<h1>Regulatory Analysis</h1>
<div class="hero-role">Technical facts first. Legal qualification second.</div>
</div>
<p class="hero-lead">
<span class="dossier-label">First dossier: France — AMF Fintech</span><br/>
              This page presents the regulatory perimeter described in the <strong>AMF Memorandum v2.0</strong>, prepared in response to the email sent by AMF Innovation &amp; Finance Digitale on 22 September 2026. The memorandum supports a request for preliminary regulatory guidance before developing a testnet pilot with a partner established in France.
            </p>
